{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["This place too is Shechem. Moses called it thus because Shechem did not exist in Abraham's days." "<b>Elon.</b> Like elah, and they are trees. Some say a field, like El Paran (Genesis 14:6)." "Moreh. Some say he is Mamre, the ally of Abraham. It is possible that he is another, and Elon Moreh was the name of the place." "<b>And the Canaanite was then in the land.</b> It is possible that Canaan seized the land of Canaan from another. And if this is not so, it has a sod, and the discerning will be silent."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:19.057506377Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}